  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zambia - Tazama Pipeline Rehabilitation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to rehabilitate Tazama Pipeline and its auxilliary systems to prevet further losses of crude oil through leakages, avoid environmental damage in Zambia and Tanzania as well to strengthen TPl management capability through training and consultancy services.</narrative>
  </description>
